And that brings us to epistemic hysteresis.

22:23.360 --> 22:26.920
To understand the breakdown, we first have to understand the admissibility log.

22:26.920 --> 22:31.560
This sounded like the black box flight recorder for the AI's belief system.

22:31.760 --> 22:33.040
