23:01.160 --> 23:04.480
I want to spend significant time on this because when I read this section,

23:04.680 --> 23:09.760
it felt like an incredibly vital concept, not just for AI, but for human cognition.

23:09.760 --> 23:14.820
It is arguably the most consequential concept in the paper regarding failure states.

23:15.440 --> 23:21.900
Epistemic hysteresis occurs when a sequence of events permanently forecloses a previously accessible belief state.

23:22.040 --> 23:25.180
Meaning a door closes and the lock breaks off behind you.

23:25.260 --> 23:27.680
You can't just hit undo or backspace.

