you can never naturally navigate back to the coordinate where you knew the difference between those states.

23:41.540 --> 23:42.080
It's just gone.

23:42.400 --> 23:44.740
The geometry of the future is permanently altered.

23:45.640 --> 23:53.320
The paper refers to the hysteresis gap as the minimum energy or information costs required to try and recover those lost distinctions.

23:53.840 --> 23:56.700
