They will achieve incredible local accuracy by finding statistical shortcuts, but they will completely lose reachability fidelity.

27:09.120 --> 27:16.880
They will become fundamentally incapable of navigating complex extended horizons because they threw away the map to pass the test.

27:17.200 --> 27:21.380
The paper argues vehemently that we need to overhaul our evaluation paradigms.

27:21.940 --> 27:28.500
We must stop testing for static factual recall and start testing for the preservation of belief manifold geometry.

27:28.720 --> 27:30.340
